    "description": {
      "value": "A spirit trap consists of a net dipped in water that has been steeped with sacred herbs to better combat phantoms. This snare's components function as a net when not set up. You set this snare up in a 10-foot-by-10-foot area. The first creature with the spirit trait that steps into the area must attempt a DC 16 Fortitude save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature is flat-footed for 1 round.\n- **Failure:** The creature is immobilized for 1 round.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is immobilized until it Escapes (DC 16)."
